# Module 3: Networking and Security (Google Cloud)

## Overview
This module focuses on networking, security, scalability, and monitoring in Google Cloud. It includes hands-on labs covering VPC networks, firewall rules, IAM roles, load balancing, Cloud Armor security, and Cloud Monitoring.

---

## Labs Completed

- Lab 01: Multiple VPC Networks (GSP211)
- Lab 02: VPC Networks Controlling Access (GSP213)
- Lab 03: Load Balancer with Cloud Armor (GSP215)
- Lab 04: Cloud Monitoring (GSP089)

---

## Skills Covered
- VPC Networking
- Firewall Rules
- IAM Security
- Load Balancing
- Cloud Armor Security
- Cloud Monitoring & Logging

